      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "01E16763DBE19008",
      "text": "歡迎光臨深缽道館！\\n要再聽一次道館測驗的說明嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "01E16A63DBE19521",
      "text": "深缽道館的道館測驗是\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]收集向日花怪[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
