    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_01",
      "hash64": "3530CCAE0E1378E7",
      "text": "我是向日花怪姐姐！\\n我負責照顧道館的向日花怪們喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_06",
      "hash64": "3530C9AE0E1373CE",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是來收集向日花怪的\\n道館測驗挑戰者吧！\\c\\n那麼，我現在就請向日花怪們\\n散到鎮上去囉！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
