    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_03",
      "hash64": "3530CEAE0E137C4D",
      "text": "集滿[VAR 0x0201(0002)]隻後，\\n就把牠們帶到這個廣場來吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_04",
      "hash64": "3530C7AE0E137068",
      "text": "謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳把向日花怪收集回來！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳通過道館測驗囉！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_05",
      "hash64": "3530C8AE0E13721B",
      "text": "去深缽道館的櫃台報告吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "01E16E63DBE19BED",
      "text": "道館測驗是收集向日花怪。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要再次挑戰嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "01E16D63DBE19A3A",
      "text": "那麼，請再集滿\\n[VAR 0x0201(0001)]隻向日花怪，\\r\\n把牠們帶到這個廣場來！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "01E16063DBE18423",
      "text": "那麼，請開始吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_kusapoke_10",
      "hash64": "F905C97956842618",
      "text": "一旦走出深缽鎮，\\n就必須重新收集向日花怪。\\r\\n……要離開深缽鎮嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_kusapoke_11",
      "hash64": "F905CA79568427CB",
      "text": "退出道館測驗了！\\n想再次挑戰時，\\r\\n就到向日花怪廣場吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
